       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FJERN-OVERSKYENDE-MELLEMRUM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PREVIOUSCHAR     PIC X       VALUE SPACE.
       01 IX-READ          PIC 99      VALUE 1.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 OUTPUT-LINJE     PIC X(90).
       01 TILFØJELSE       PIC X(90).
       01 IX-OUT           PIC 99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING OUTPUT-LINJE TILFØJELSE IX-OUT.
       PERFORM VARYING IX-READ FROM 1 BY 1 
               UNTIL IX-READ > LENGTH OF TILFØJELSE
           IF PREVIOUSCHAR NOT = SPACE 
                   OR TILFØJELSE(IX-READ:1) NOT = SPACE
              MOVE TILFØJELSE(IX-READ:1) TO OUTPUT-LINJE(IX-OUT:1)
              ADD 1 TO IX-OUT
           END-IF
           MOVE TILFØJELSE(IX-READ:1) TO PREVIOUSCHAR
       END-PERFORM
       SUBTRACT 1 FROM IX-OUT
       EXIT PROGRAM.
